### 4.3 The sum identities

Because `deg p_f<deg p_g` and `p_g` is squarefree, partial fractions and (4.1)
give

```text
p_f(pi)/p_g(pi)
 = sum_i [p_f(c_i)/p_g'(c_i)]/(pi-c_i)
