+## 5. Disposition vectors
+
+### 5.1 The 46 `APPROACHES.md` rows
+
+Legend: `U` unchanged, `R` raise, `L` lower, `O` reopen, `RT` retype, and
+`P` provisional.  This is a complete positional vector against the numbered
+master table at `APPROACHES.md:188-235`:
